    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;16.16</strong> Peutz&ndash;Jeghers syndrome cancer risks for specific anatomical localizations at 65&ndash;70&nbsp;years of age</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Brosens LAA",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Site</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>Cancer risk</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Colorectum</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">39%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Small intestine</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">13%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Stomach</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">29%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Pancreas</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">11&ndash;36%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Breast</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">32&ndash;54%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Uterus</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">9%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Ovary</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">21%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Cervix</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">10%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Testis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">9%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Lung</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.7pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">7&ndash;17%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
